caroni]]\n* ½ [[Cookbook:Pound|pound]] grated [[Cookbook:Cheddar Cheese|cheddar cheese]]\n* ⅔ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] [[Cookbook:Milk|milk]]\n* ½ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] [[Cookbook:Mustard|dry mustard]]\n* ½ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] [[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]] [[Cookbook:Onion|onion]]\n* 1 can (10¾ [[Cookbook:Ounce|ounces]]) cream of [[Cookbook:Celery|celery]] soup\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n* 1 can (14¾ ounces) [[Cookbook:Salmon|salmon]]\n* 1 bag (8 ounces) frozen [[cookbook:Pea|peas]]\n* 1 cup [[Cookbook:Bread Crumb|bread crumbs]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tablespoons]] [[Cookbook:Butter|butter]], melted\n\n==Procedure==\n\n# Preheat [[Cookbook:Oven|oven]] to [[Cookbook:Oven temperatures|350°F]] (175°C).\n# Cook macaroni according to package directions; drain.\n# In a large bowl, combine cheese, macaroni, milk, dry mustard, onion, soup, and salt.\n# Add salmon and frozen peas.\n# Place in a greased 9 x 13-[[Cookbook:Inch|inch]] pan.\n# Cover mixture with bread crumbs; drizzle with melted butter.\n# [[Cookbook:Baking|Bake]] for 45 minutes.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using pasta and noodles]]\n[[Category:Recipes using salmon]]\n[[Category:Recipes for casserole]]\n[[Category:Baked recipes]]\n[[Category:Main course recipes]]\n[[Category:United States recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using butter]]\n[[Category:Recipes using celery]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cheddar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using bread crumb]]\n[[Category:Recipes using peas]]\n[[Category:Recipes using butter]]\n[[Category:Recipes using milk]]\n[[Category:Recipes using mustard powder]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Fisherman's Casserole","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 package (8 ounces) macaroni","sourceText":"1 package (8 ounces) macaroni","amountText":"1 package (8 ounces) macaroni","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"½ pound grated cheddar cheese","sourceText":